== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Saturnus|Saturnus]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod.
* Saturnus' effects reference the planet [[Wikipedia:Saturn|Saturn]], known for its prominent [[Wikipedia:Rings of Saturn|ring system]].

